@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About · AVI Robotics</PageTitle>
<HeadContent><meta name="description" content="Who AVI Robotics is, what our name means, and how the club runs." /></HeadContent>

<PageHero Kicker="About" Title="Ars Vallis Ingenium">
    <p>Latin, roughly <em>“the craft of Valley ingenuity.”</em> We picked it because the Central Valley builds things, and so do we.</p>
</PageHero>

<section class="section">
    <div class="wrap split">
        <div class="split__head">
            <Eyebrow>The club</Eyebrow>
            <h2 class="h2">Student-run, build-first.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
            <p>AVI Robotics is a student engineering club at Fresno State. Members come from mechanical, electrical and computer engineering, computer science, and plenty of majors that have nothing to do with any of those.</p>
            <p>The club is the umbrella. Competition teams live inside it. Our first is <a href="/teams/sms">Sequoia Marine Solutions</a>, which builds an underwater ROV for the MATE ROV Competition every season.</p>
            <p>You don't need experience to join. You need to show up, ask questions and be willing to get your hands dirty (or wet).</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper-2">
    <div class="wrap split">
        <div class="split__head">
            <Eyebrow>How we run</Eyebrow>
            <h2 class="h2">Organized like an engineering firm.</h2>
        </div>
        <SpecSheet Rows="@howWeRun" />
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="wrap split">
        <div class="split__head">
            <Eyebrow>Leadership</Eyebrow>
            <h2 class="h2">Officers</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="note">TODO(confirm): officer names, roles and photos. Only with each person's OK.</p>
    </div>
</section>

